    <main class="wrap section">
      <div class="eyebrow">Free evidence access · optional member support</div>
      <h1>MEMBERSHIP.</h1>
      <p class="lead"><strong>The underlying public-source evidence is available to Free Members.</strong> Paid tiers add curation, delivery, monitoring, exports, research tools and member services.</p>
      <p><strong>Evidence boundary:</strong> membership does not turn allegations into facts, guarantee that requested records exist, or promise a particular conclusion.</p>

      <section class="section evidence-promise" aria-labelledby="evidence-access-promise">
        <div class="eyebrow">Evidence access promise</div>
        <h2 id="evidence-access-promise">THE EVIDENCE IS FREE. DONATIONS FUND THE MACHINE.</h2>
        <p><strong>Free Member access includes the same underlying public-source evidence used by Supporter, Intelligence Member and Research Pro.</strong></p>
        <p>Higher levels provide added convenience and service: curated briefings, more frequent delivery, watchlists, source-change monitoring, downloadable formats, advanced filters and research workflow tools.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="section money-card" aria-labelledby="free-brief-heading">
        <h2 id="free-brief-heading">Get the free Daily Control Brief</h2>
        <p>Join the free list for public briefings and release notices. Marketing preferences can be changed or withdrawn at any time.</p>
        <form id="newsletter-form" data-newsletter-form class="email-capture">
          <input name="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Name (optional)" aria-label="Name">
          <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" aria-label="Email address" required>
          <button class="btn" type="submit">Join Free Brief</button>
          <p class="form-status newsletter-status" aria-live="polite">Your email and consent are stored only when the signup service confirms success.</p>
        </form>
      </section>

      <section class="section membership-tier-section" aria-labelledby="membership-tier-heading">
        <div class="eyebrow">Four cumulative service levels · free membership never requires PayPal</div>
        <h2 id="membership-tier-heading">MEMBERSHIP TIERS.</h2>
        <p class="lead">Every level can examine the same underlying evidence. Each paid level adds service, organisation and research functionality. Paid checkout remains disabled until the sandbox or live activation gates are deliberately enabled.</p>
        <div id="paypal-membership-status" class="membership-status">Checking PayPal checkout readiness…</div>
        <p data-paypal-login class="login-required" hidden><a class="btn" href="member-login.html?return=%2Fmembership.html">Log in to choose a paid tier</a></p>

        <div class="money-grid membership-grid">
          <article class="money-card membership-tier" id="join-free-member" data-tier-price="0">
            <div class="tier-top"><span class="label">Permanent account</span><span class="tier-code">€0 / forever</span></div>
            <h3>Free Member</h3><div class="price"><span>€0</span><small>no card required</small></div>
            <p>Create a passwordless account and keep your personal Matrix Reprogrammed workspace.</p>
            <h4>Benefits</h4><ul class="tier-benefits"><li>Same underlying public-source evidence used across all tiers</li><li>Free member dashboard</li><li>Passwordless login and session controls</li><li>Save public reports and cards</li><li>Follow public topics</li><li>Public weekly archive</li><li>Newsletter and release preferences</li><li>Public download history</li></ul>
            <h4>Access included</h4><div class="tier-access"><span>Public evidence</span><span>Free dashboard</span><span>Saved content</span><span>Topic follows</span><span>Public archive</span><span>Preferences</span></div>
            <p class="tier-boundary"><strong>Billing boundary:</strong> Free Member access never creates a PayPal subscription and never requires payment details.</p>
            <div class="free-tier-action"><a class="btn" href="member-login.html?return=%2Fmember-dashboard.html">Create or access free account</a></div>
          </article>

          <article class="money-card membership-tier" id="join-supporter" data-tier-price="3">
            <div class="tier-top"><span class="label">Monthly donation</span><span class="tier-code">€3 / month</span></div>
            <h3>Supporter</h3><div class="price"><span>€3</span><small>per month</small></div>
            <p>A low-cost way to support the project and receive the core weekly member layer.</p><p class="tier-includes"><strong>Everything in Free Member</strong></p>
            <h4>Benefits</h4><ul class="tier-benefits"><li>Weekly member intelligence brief</li><li>Member newsletter and editorial notes</li><li>Curated public-source drops and source collections</li><li>Selected supporter downloads and convenient formats</li><li>Weekly brief archive</li><li>Supporter announcements and surveys</li></ul>
            <p class="tier-boundary"><strong>Evidence promise:</strong> payment supports the project and added member services; the underlying public-source evidence remains available through Free Member access.</p>
            <div id="paypal-button-supporter" class="paypal-slot" aria-label="Supporter PayPal checkout"></div>
          </article>

          <article class="money-card membership-tier" id="join-intelligence-member" data-tier-price="6">
            <div class="tier-top"><span class="label">Monthly donation</span><span class="tier-code">€6 / month</span></div>
            <h3>Intelligence Member</h3><div class="price"><span>€6</span><small>per month</small></div>
            <p>The day-to-day intelligence layer for readers who want evidence organised, monitored and delivered more frequently.</p><p class="tier-includes"><strong>Everything in Supporter and Free Member</strong></p>
            <h4>Benefits</h4><ul class="tier-benefits"><li>Premium daily intelligence brief</li><li>Full card context and evidence notes</li><li>Deeper evidence-bounded dossiers and organised research routes</li><li>Entity and institution following</li><li>Watchlists and source-change tracking</li><li>Downloadable PDF and CSV releases</li></ul>
            <p class="tier-boundary"><strong>Evidence promise:</strong> this level adds monitoring, organisation, analysis and delivery tools, not exclusive ownership of evidence.</p>
            <div id="paypal-button-intelligence" class="paypal-slot" aria-label="Intelligence Member PayPal checkout"></div>
          </article>

          <article class="money-card membership-tier" id="join-research-pro" data-tier-price="9">
            <div class="tier-top"><span class="label">Monthly donation</span><span class="tier-code">€9 / month</span></div>
            <h3>Research Pro</h3><div class="price"><span>€9</span><small>per month</small></div>
            <p>The advanced workspace for investigators, writers and serious public-record researchers who want stronger filters, exports and workflow tools.</p><p class="tier-includes"><strong>Everything in Intelligence Member, Supporter and Free Member</strong></p>
            <h4>Benefits</h4><ul class="tier-benefits"><li>Advanced watchlist criteria</li><li>Full dossier and evidence-path exports</li><li>Monthly PDF intelligence report</li><li>Policy and jurisdiction trackers</li><li>Citation and bibliography exports</li><li>Research queue and priority source requests</li><li>PDF, CSV and JSON research bundles</li></ul>
            <p class="tier-boundary"><strong>Request boundary:</strong> priority requests enter a review queue. They do not guarantee that a record exists, can be lawfully obtained, or will support a requested conclusion.</p>
            <div id="paypal-button-research_pro" class="paypal-slot" aria-label="Research Pro PayPal checkout"></div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="membership-checkout-consent" class="section checkout-consent" data-terms-version="2026-07-18-v1" data-withdrawal-version="2026-07-18-v1" aria-labelledby="membership-consent-heading">
        <div class="eyebrow">Required before paid checkout</div>
        <h2 id="membership-consent-heading">RECURRING MEMBERSHIP AGREEMENT.</h2>
        <p>PayPal checkout will not open until every acknowledgement below is selected. The server records the accepted versions, account, tier, timestamp and checkout intent.</p>
        <div class="consent-list">
          <label><input id="membership-terms-accepted" type="checkbox"><span>I have read and accept the <a href="membership-terms.html">Membership Terms</a>.</span></label>
          <label><input id="membership-recurring-acknowledged" type="checkbox"><span>I understand the selected amount is charged every month through PayPal until I cancel.</span></label>
          <label><input id="membership-immediate-service-requested" type="checkbox"><span>I expressly request the digital member service to begin immediately after PayPal confirms an active subscription.</span></label>
          <label><input id="membership-withdrawal-notice-acknowledged" type="checkbox"><span>I have read the <a href="cancellation-withdrawal.html">cancellation and withdrawal notice</a> and understand that statutory rights are preserved unless a valid legal exception applies.</span></label>
        </div>
        <p class="commercial-boundary"><strong>Commercial boundary:</strong> checkout approval alone does not grant access. Entitlements change only after verified PayPal billing state. You can cancel through the billing dashboard; access continues only for any verified paid period that remains.</p>
        <div class="legal-links"><a class="btn alt" href="membership-terms.html">Membership Terms</a><a class="btn alt" href="cancellation-withdrawal.html">Cancellation &amp; Withdrawal</a><a class="btn alt" href="legal-notice.html">Legal Notice</a><a class="btn alt" href="trust-privacy-policy.html">Privacy Policy</a></div>
      </section>

      <section class="section membership-comparison" aria-labelledby="membership-comparison-heading">
        <div class="eyebrow">Evidence and service comparison</div><h2 id="membership-comparison-heading">SAME EVIDENCE. DIFFERENT SERVICE LAYERS.</h2>
        <div class="membership-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Access or service</th><th scope="col">Free Member<br><small>€0</small></th><th scope="col">Supporter<br><small>€3</small></th><th scope="col">Intelligence<br><small>€6</small></th><th scope="col">Research Pro<br><small>€9</small></th></tr></thead><tbody>
          <tr><th scope="row">Underlying public-source evidence</th><td>✓</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Passwordless account and dashboard</th><td>✓</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Save public content and follow public topics</th><td>✓</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Weekly curated member brief</th><td>—</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Premium daily delivery and source-change monitoring</th><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Advanced filters, exports and research workflow tools</th><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✓</td></tr>
        </tbody></table></div>
        <p class="tier-boundary"><strong>Billing boundary:</strong> Free Member access never touches PayPal. Paid plans are recurring membership payments and are not charitable donations or tax-deductible gifts unless separately confirmed under applicable law.</p>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer class="footer wrap"><p><strong>MATRIX REPROGRAMMED</strong> — public records, evidence boundaries and clearly labelled analysis.</p><p><a href="membership-terms.html">Membership Terms</a> · <a href="cancellation-withdrawal.html">Cancellation &amp; Withdrawal</a> · <a href="legal-notice.html">Legal Notice</a> · <a href="trust-privacy-policy.html">Privacy</a></p></footer>
